  "provenance": {
    "source_notes": "Reference for this template's layout, text, and colors came from a clean, isolated plate texture the Forza Writer user supplied -- one of a set of thirteen originally extracted from GTA V's companion iFruit app (not this app's own game files, and not a screenshot taken in-game) and posted publicly to Reddit by u/sgtfrankieboy. A novelty plate referencing Liberty City (the setting of other GTA games, not San Andreas) the app offers as a selectable design in GTA V. A solid navy header band across the top third carries 'LIBERTY CITY' in bold silver-gray italic capitals; two empty corner boxes sit in that band -- no sticker content is visible on this variant, unlike the San Andreas plates' filled-in stickers, so these are modeled as plain empty sticker-shaped decorations rather than guessing at content. This 'BY' (blue and yellow) variant's body is a solid gold/yellow (#E8B637, sampled directly), no divider lines. Positions are approximated by eye against the reference image's own proportions, not pixel-measured the way gta-sa-passenger-fictional's were.",
